WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.518 --> 00:00:03.281
Morning begins at the river Kolpa.

00:00:03.448 --> 00:00:04.688
and you are in.

00:00:04.852 --> 00:00:06.562
The Kolpa never hurries.

00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:09.844
Two houses, two addresses in Griblje.

00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:12.656
Four self-contained apartments.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.406
A terrace, a hot tub, a garden.

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:19.219
and a whole meadow for the children.

00:00:19.869 --> 00:00:22.969
Guests say: complete privacy.

00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:25.781
and lights after dark.

00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:30.000
River Kolpa Apartments. Call Majda.
